riptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joaomoreno/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joaomoreno/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joaomoreno/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joaomoreno/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joaomoreno/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":true},"content_type":"application/octet-stream","state":"uploaded","size":5138,"digest":"sha256:b019b2106e670564bc6c9efe6dfdfdd1ad746db1261e629a8ca464a667b0e828","download_count":5,"created_at":"2025-10-24T04:22:55Z","updated_at":"2025-10-24T04:22:55Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/microsoft/vscode-copilot-chat/releases/download/v0.33.2025102404/extension.vsixmanifest"}],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vscode-copilot-chat/tarball/v0.33.2025102404","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vscode-copilot-chat/zipball/v0.33.2025102404","body":"\n\n## Changes:\n\n* #1537: Adopt CAPI token enablement prop\n* #1566: Update vscode-capi and don't send integration-id for proxy requests\n* #1571: Add model hash\n* #1572: Quick pick chat sessions uri handler\n* #1570: Fix open in browser and follow up in cloud sessions\n* #1563: Add model\n* #1568: Update configuration for agents\n* #1480: Adopt resources for identifying sessions\n* #1565: Update view placeholders\n* #1481: Support for opening session on different workspace\n<details><summary><b>See More</b></summary>\n\n* #1561: Address CustomOAI/Azure BYOK response API path resolution\n* #1516: Install and proxy GHPR commands (starting with `github.copilot.cloud.sessions.proxy.closeChatSessionPullRequest`)\n* #1554: nes: long distance: show nicer label for typescript\n* #1560: Treat empty tool call arguments as {} to avoid JSON parse errors\n* #1559: Last tests ported over from Copilot client\n* #1557: Add some logging around notebook summary and variable retrieval\n* #1504: Custom vsc model prompt \n* #1558: Avoid hiding copilot cli terminals\n* #1556: Introduce ScenarioAutomationEndpointProvider Implementation\n* #1553: Ensure we can load copilotcli sessions even if one fails to load\n* #1552: nes: feat: show label only if there's an edit from production model\n* #1301: Allow exp of default model\n* #1548: chore: bump package.json engine version\n* #1545: Add tests for Snippy functionality\n* #1547: Ignore git virtual files\n* #1544: nes: long distance nes: show label but don't fetch next edit\n* #1543: altAction: fix: support for csv files & adopt new format of Data\n* #1223: nes: set telemetry for edit window expanded to include a merge conflict\n* #1542: Make prompt tests work again. Port over more tests from client\n* #1540: Make PromptRegistry able to register matchers and check promptsWithMatcher first\n* #1521: More tests\n\nThis list of changes was [auto generated](https://dev.azure.com/monacotools/Monaco/_build/results?buildId=367530&view=logs).</details>","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vscode-copilot-chat/releases/256889045/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0}}}